             </p>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-4\">\n                    <a href=\"https://wa.me/919727257141\" class=\"bg-green-500 hover:bg-green-600 text-white font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full flex items-center shadow-lg transition duration-300\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2\" fill=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M.057 24l1.687-6.163c-1.041-1.804-1.588-3.849-1.588-5.946 0-6.556 5.332-11.888 11.888-11.888 3.176 0 6.161 1.237 8.404 3.48s3.481 5.229 3.481 8.404c0 6.556-5.332 11.888-11.888 11.888-2.013 0-3.987-.512-5.735-1.483l-6.249 1.708zm6.303-4.463c1.554.92 3.402 1.403 5.284 1.403 5.614 0 10.185-4.571 10.185-10.185 0-2.719-1.059-5.277-2.983-7.201s-4.482-2.983-7.202-2.983c-5.614 0-10.185 4.571-10.185 10.185 0 1.957.561 3.864 1.623 5.513l-1.066 3.89 3.987-1.091z\"/></svg>\n                        WhatsApp Morbi Booking\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"/ac-repair-service-price-list-air-conditioner-repair-service-cost-in-vadodara-gujarat\" class=\"bg-yellow-400 text-blue-900 font-bold py-4 px-8 rounded-full shadow-lg hover:bg-yellow-500 transition duration-300\">\n                        View Rates\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"md:w-1/2 flex justify-center\">\n                <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Atlas-aircon-vehicle.webp\" alt=\"Atlas Aircon AC Repair Morbi Service Fleet\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl border-8 border-yellow-400 transform rotate-2\" title=\"\">\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Pros and Cons Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-white\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-12 uppercase tracking-wide\">Why Choose <b>Atlas Aircon</b> for AC Repair in Morbi</h2>\n            <div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10\">\n                <div class=\"bg-yellow-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-yellow-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-orange-700\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-yellow-600\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z\"></path></svg>\n                        Service Advantages\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4\">\n                        <li><b>Local reach</b> serving Ravapar, Sanala, and Ceramic GIDC belts.</li>\n                        <li><b>Skilled technicians</b> trained for industrial chiller and panel AC needs.</li>\n                        <li>Use of <b>genuine copper pipes</b> and OEM spare parts for longevity.</li>\n                        <li><b>Transparent billing</b> with no hidden visit or repair charges.</li>\n                        <li><b>Rapid arrival</b> for critical breakdown calls in industrial zones.</li>\n                        <li><b>Expert troubleshooting</b> for ceramic-industry dust protection.</li>\n                        <li><b>Standard warranty</b> on compressor repairs and PCB electronics.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"bg-orange-50 p-8 rounded-xl shadow-inner border-l-8 border-orange-500\">\n                    <h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold mb-6 flex items-center text-blue-900\">\n                        <svg class=\"w-6 h-6 mr-2 text-orange-500\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z\"></path></svg>\n                        AC Performance Risks\n                    </h3>\n                    <ul class=\"space-y-4 text-gray-700\">\n                        <li>Ceramic dust leads to <b>rapidly blocked evaporator coils</b>.</li>\n                        <li>High temperatures cause <b>frequent compressor tripping</b> without service.</li>\n                        <li>Low refrigerant levels result in <b>high electricity consumption</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Dust infiltration causes <b>indoor fan motor jamming</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Corrosive environments lead to <b>copper pipe gas leaks</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Neglected master cleaning leads to <b>poor air filtration</b>.</li>\n                        <li>Skipping maintenance results in <b>sudden system failure</b> in peak heat.</li>\n                    </ul>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n\n    <!-- Morbi Product Section -->\n    <section class=\"py-16 bg-yellow-50\">\n        <div class=\"container mx-auto px-6\">\n            <h2 class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-center mb-4 text-blue-900\">Which Types of Products We Repair</h2>\n            <p class=\"text-center text-gray-600 mb-12\">Total cooling maintenance for residential and the ceramic industrial belt of Morbi.</p>\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\">\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/Window-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Window AC Repair Morbi\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/window-ac-service-morbi\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Window AC Service</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Deep <b>window ac repair</b> including high-pressure cleaning and motor work.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/window-ac-service-morbi\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Morbi</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/chiller-service-in-vadodara.webp\" alt=\"Chiller Repair Morbi\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-morbi\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Chiller Repair</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Heavy-duty <b>chiller maintenance</b> for Morbi manufacturing units.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/chiller-repair-services-morbi\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Morbi</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl\">\n                    <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://atlasaircons.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/advance-panel-ac-repair-service.webp\" alt=\"Panel AC Repair Morbi\" class=\"w-full h-40 object-cover rounded-lg mb-4\" title=\"\">\n                    <h4 class=\"font-bold text-lg mb-2\"><a href=\"/panel-ac-service-morbi\" class=\"text-orange-600\">Panel AC Repair</a></h4>\n                    <p class=\"text-sm text-gray-500 mb-4\">Crucial <b>panel ac service</b> for sensitive electronic plant controls.</p>\n                    <a href=\"/panel-ac-service-morbi\" class=\"text-blue-800 font-bold hover:underline\">Book in Morbi</a>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"service-card bg-white p-6 rounded-xl shadow hover:shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-center\">\n                    <svg class=\"w-16 h-16 text-yellow-500 mb-4\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M19 11H5m14 0a2 